# One line-ending policy for the whole repository. Biome writes LF, and with
# only core.autocrlf on a Windows checkout every file Biome visited showed
# as modified (CRLF in the tree, LF from the formatter) even when nothing
# changed — a formatting pass over one folder once produced 138 spurious
# modifications. apps/mobile already pinned itself to LF for the same
# reason; this extends that to web, admin, packages, docs and SQL.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.p8 binary
*.p12 binary
